.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class REGION_COMPLEX> size_t \fBcsmp::RegionInterface\fP< dim, REGION_COMPLEX >::FormModelRegion (bool is_unique)"

.PP
builds master region '\fBModel\fP' (discontigous or not) including all elements (line, surface, or volume if any); this regions is then used to build others Takes all elements from the mesh manager and creates a region that contains them\&.

.PP
Uses the highest order of elements (dim == model dimension) to perform a flood fill to determine whether the region is contiguous\&.

.PP
